It’s a Pyramid!

1636
00:50:23,979 --> 00:50:24,678
Perfect.

1637
00:50:24,679 --> 00:50:25,478
[OMG!]
Oh my god!

1638
00:50:25,479 --> 00:50:26,445
Perfect!

1639
00:50:26,446 --> 00:50:28,178
