How much is it?

1642
00:50:32,112 --> 00:50:33,178
[Don’t worry about money]
Don't worry.

1643
00:50:33,311 --> 00:50:36,945
Try it on first.
I’ll tell you the price later.

1644
00:50:37,078 --> 00:50:37,611
A-HA!

1645
00:50:37,612 --> 00:50:39,578
- WOW!
- Wow!!

1646
00:50:41,145 --> 00:50:41,978
(WoW)

1647
00:50:41,979 --> 00:50:43,445
Wow!

1648
00:50:44,245 --> 00:50:46,278
When I said I wanted to buy it,

1649
