But, are you gonna change your mind after saying that?

1712
00:52:33,279 --> 00:52:33,778
Give him 50,000 won.

1713
00:52:33,779 --> 00:52:35,145
I'll pay 50,000 bucks for him.

1714
00:52:35,445 --> 00:52:36,078
